          "raw": "<card title=\"Make the gatte dough\"><bullets><point>Mix besan, chili, salt, turmeric, yogurt and oil in a bowl</point><point>Add water a little at a time to a soft, pliable dough</point><point>Knead lightly until smooth, about 3-4 min; don't overwork</point></bullets><visual query=\"\" title=\"Make the gatte dough\" url=\"https://image-ops-uat.glance-cdn.com/resize?img_url=https%3A%2F%2Fm-us-mob-ailooks-uat.glance-cdn.com%2Fglance-tv%2Fcontent-generation%2Faigc%2Fimages%2Ff2e702fd-9477-4d9e-97da-0eac113ffc5c_20260313_094638%2Fpre_selfie.png&w=840&h=1050&fit=crop&fmt=webp\"/></card>"
