          "raw": "<card title=\"Cook the kadhi gravy\"><bullets><point>Whisk yogurt, besan, coriander, paprika, turmeric, chili, salt + 2 cups water to a smooth batter</point><point>Pour into the tempering off a rolling boil, stirring constantly</point><point>Simmer gently 8-10 min until it thickens slightly</point></bullets><visual query=\"\" title=\"Cook the kadhi gravy\" url=\"https://image-ops-uat.glance-cdn.com/resize?img_url=https%3A%2F%2Fm-us-mob-ailooks-uat.glance-cdn.com%2Fglance-tv%2Fcontent-generation%2Faigc%2Fimages%2Fa256536a-e585-4236-82ea-6b283f8bbcc0_20260507_060633%2Fpre_selfie.webp&w=840&h=1050&fit=crop&fmt=webp\"/></card>"
