                "openNow": true,
                "phone": "096634 78086",
                "reviews": [
                  {
                    "author": "Kyoko Chan",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": "Good experience! Veg choices are good too with tofu and vegetables the centre. Good quantity and quick service of the orders! The staff were helpful with picking out our choices and very friendly with the questions (including catering to an unexpected request for burnt garlic 😂)!  The atmosphere is very nice too with thai music playing and overall it's a good place for trying out thai cuisine!",
                    "published": "2 months ago"
                  },
                  {
                    "author": "Kirti",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": "Excellent food. Period. Too good. Must try. We tried scallops in chilli paste (simply awsome. The chilli paste/sauce was so too good. It was in the day's specials menu), Thai green curry, papaya salad, mango sticky rice, bagel tea(very soothing, especially cs i had a cold and it felt good), Thai tea iced. (very good). The quality of the food was too good and thats all I can say. Very hard to describe anything as its more of a feeling.",
                    "published": "4 months ago"
                  },
                  {
                    "author": "Melli Lali",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": "Authentic Thai cuisine in the heart of Kammanahalli. 🇹🇭✨This cozy little spot may be small, but it delivers big on flavor and authenticity. A must-try is the Khao Pad Rotfai Seafood Fried Rice and the Som Tum with fermented fish both bursting with bold, traditional Thai flavors. Every bite is incredibly satisfying and comforting, making for a truly soul-satisfying dining experience. Highly recommended!",
                    "published": "2 months ago"
                  },
                  {
                    "author": "Susmita Bishnu",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": "This is a very clean and cozy resturant very accessible still feels like in its own corner.\nAnd the food is very good.\nThis was the first time I visited this place and surely will be revisiting beacuse the food is yummy 😋.\nOrdered spring roll, pork ribs and Thai red curry.\nThe waitresses taking the order is patient to hear and answer your queries and even provide you with the most feasible to way to order something to your liking and spice level .",
                    "published": "a month ago"
                  },
                  {
                    "author": "ramesh krishna",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": "this place is a gem, i tried thai cuisines in multiple places and only in few places you would feel the authenticity. this place is one. it is a small restaurant and chef is thai. so you know, that you have landed up in for right taste.\n\nmust try: tom yum soup- the portion can serve 3-4 ppl.",
                    "published": "4 months ago"
                  }
                ],
