            "reviews": [
              {
                "author": "Abhiroop Basu",
                "rating": 5,
                "text": "Excellent food. Even more unbelievable pricing. Must try for authentic Thai cuisine, it's actually really great for Indian tastebuds.",
                "published": "2 months ago"
              },
              {
                "author": "Pratyaksh Mundra",
                "rating": 5,
                "text": "Ok so i have basically tried most thai places in bangalore, but i have to be honest this is the best thai place in bangalore hands down.\nOn first glance this shop moght seem unassuming, but the food is made by an actual thai person and the food is as good as what i ate in thailand. And it is also very cheap, basically each dish is just 200 rs.\n\n10/10 recommended",
                "published": "a month ago"
              },
              {
                "author": "SUBRAJIT PANDEY",
                "rating": 5,
                "text": "Authentic Thai food made with love team who brought the taste of Thailand to Bangalore. Great food, warm hospitality, and true Thai flavors. Highly recommended! 🇹🇭🍜",
                "published": "2 months ago"
              },
              {
                "author": "Jm Reillo",
                "rating": 5,
                "text": "Krung Thep Thai Street Food is one of the best places in Bangalore for authentic Thai cuisine. The flavors are incredibly authentic, and every dish we tried was fresh, flavorful, and perfectly prepared. The menu offers a wide variety of options, making it easy to find something for everyone, whether you enjoy spicy curries, noodles, or classic Thai appetizers. The staff were warm, friendly, and attentive, making the entire dining experience even more enjoyable. If you’re looking for delicious Thai food with excellent service, Krung Thep is definitely worth a visit. Highly recommended!",
                "published": "a month ago"
              },
              {
                "author": "Dinesh Kumar",
                "rating": 5,
                "text": "Absolutely loved this place! The food is incredibly authentic and tastes just like real Thai street food. Every dish was fresh, flavorful, and packed with authentic Thai flavors. What made the experience even better was the owners—they are extremely friendly, welcoming, and passionate about their food. They made us feel right at home. If you're craving genuine Thai street food, this place is definitely worth a visit. Highly recommended!",
                "published": "a month ago"
              }
            ],
