              "availability": "Monday: 12:00 – 11:00 PM · Tuesday: 12:00 – 11:00 PM · Wednesday: 12:00 – 11:00 PM · Thursday: 12:00 – 11:00 PM · Friday: 12:00 – 11:00 PM · Saturday: 12:00 – 11:00 PM · Sunday: 12:00 – 11:00 PM",
