      "kind": "entity_rail",
      "headline": "Quick heads-up: a true Sonoran quesadilla (carne asada in a soft flour tortilla) is a specific regional style, and none of these are strictly Sonoran. But these are Bengaluru's highest-rated, family-friendly Mexican spots that serve fresh, warm, melty quesadillas — ranked by rating, with the most kid-welcoming one first.",
