            "editorialSummary": "Warm, classically furnished eatery offering Italian dishes in an old-school dining room.",
            "reviews": [
              {
                "author": "Ashwini Das",
                "rating": 5,
                "text": "Chianti has been a place I 've always loved to go to . There is something in the environment they create that you end up loving it . The staff is very courteous , helpful and always there.\n\nFood as usual was yummy , the mushroom garlic bread , aubergine and Ravioli is still lingering in my taste buds.\n\nIf you love Italian , then this is the place to be . Thier menu is great with a wide variety and the ingredients are super fresh . And oh yes , there are some yummy breads you get on the house which is not worth missing",
                "published": "2 months ago"
              },
              {
                "author": "Isha Gupta (isha)",
                "rating": 5,
                "text": "The food was great. Really good ambience and I love their ragu and pomodoro sauce. Giving a star less only because the salt was a little more than I’d like.\nThe menu is nicely done, with a lot of meat options which (non pasta/pizza) which is something I liked.\nWe started off with a little on the house bruschetta making session which was sweet!",
                "published": "6 months ago"
              },
              {
                "author": "ARNAV SINGH",
                "rating": 5,
                "text": "Chianti is a fantastic place if you’re looking for authentic Italian cuisine. The ambiance is warm and inviting, making it a great choice for a relaxed lunch or dinner.\n\nThe pastas are incredibly creamy, rich, and full of flavor, while the pizzas are equally impressive with fresh ingredients and a perfectly baked crust. Overall, a wonderful dining experience and definitely one of the best places in Bangalore for Italian food.",
                "published": "2 months ago"
              },
              {
                "author": "Paramita Santra",
                "rating": 5,
                "text": "Loved the food. Every single dish was so well presented and delicious. Every single detail complement each other. None of the elements were extra or just for garnish. You can literally wipe the plate clean like we did. They also offered fresh baked breads for us to try when we waited for our food and also had a little DIY food which we tried making ourselves.\n\nThe staff was very attentive and constantly took care of plates, breads, and even asked us if everything is to our likings. It’s gives you a ambience of an authentic Italian restaurant with wine. I highly recommend it and I might just visit until I taste everything on the menu lol.",
                "published": "4 months ago"
              },
              {
                "author": "Tashi Dhondup",
                "rating": 5,
                "text": "Had a wonderful dining experience here. The food was absolutely delicious, we especially loved the chicken dish and the pasta, both were cooked perfectly and full of flavour. The service was spot on and truly elevated the overall experience. When you get amazing food paired with excellent service, there’s nothing like it.\n\nA special mention to Shant, our server, who was extremely hospitable, friendly, and made us feel very comfortable throughout. He was attentive, helpful, and ensured everything was taken care of smoothly. Highly recommended, and we will definitely be back.",
                "published": "7 months ago"
              }
            ],
