      "kind": "entity_rail",
      "headline": "If you're after a warm, symbolic tangyuan to close out Lunar New Year, these are Bengaluru's highest-rated authentic Chinese kitchens where that dessert is most likely on the menu. I'd start with Mahjong Room or Yauatcha for the most refined Cantonese preparation, and confirm the festive dessert by phone before you go.",
      "summary": "Here's your shortlist for a warm, symbolic tangyuan this Lunar New Year, ranked by how likely each spot is to nail that authentic glutinous-rice-ball dessert.\n\nOne honest note: none of the reviews I pulled explicitly name tangyuan, so I've ranked these by how likely each kitchen is to serve it authentically (Cantonese/dim-sum specialists first). A quick call to confirm the dessert and any Lunar New Year set menu will lock it in.",
